Scenario: Add KB Article With HTML Via KB Admin
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|kbArticleContentSource||
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleAddViaSource|true|
		|kbArticleContentSource|${kbArticleContentSource}|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And Pause the value '5000'
	And KBArticle view CP With HTML
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base’s Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	Then AssertElementNotPresent the value '${kbArticleContentSource}' at locator 'KnowledgeBaseArticle#CONTENT'
Scenario: Add KB Article With Invalid Attachment Size
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPKnowledgebase#AddKBArticleWithInvalidAttachmentSize|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration configure File Upload Overall Maximum File Size
		|maxFileSize|2048|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP With Invalid Attachment Size
		|kbArticleAttachment|Document_1.png|
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
		|maxFileSize|2048|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	Then KBArticle view CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
		|noAttachment|true|
